            %li#GellMann83
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Murray+Gell-Mann"}> Murray Gell-Mann
                , introductory talk at
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shelter_Island_Conference"} Shelter Island II
                (1983) &amp;lbrack;
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Gell-Mann_ShelterIslandII_1983.pdf", :title => "pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Gell-Mann-ShelterIslandII_1983.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
              %p
                in:
                = succeed "." do
                  %em Shelter Island II: Proceedings of the 1983 Shelter Island Conference on Quantum Field Theory and the Fundamental Problems of Physics
              %blockquote
                %p “we seem to have to dial various renormalized quantities to small values. The situation of having numerous arbitrary dimensional parameters is even more humiliating when some of them are very small. &amp;lbrack;…&amp;rbrack; First of all, we’d like to interpret small or nearly symmetric quantities as coming from a slightly broken symmetry; otherwise they don’t make sense to us. &amp;lbrack;…&amp;rbrack; When we can’t avoid dialing some renormalized quantity to a small value &amp;lbrack;…&amp;rbrack; that situation has recently been described as a problem of ‘naturalness’.”
          %p Survey and further discussion:
          %ul
            %li#Clarke17
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jackson+Clarke"}> Jackson Clarke
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a{:href => "http://syymmetries.blogspot.de/2017/06/naturalness-pragmatists-guide.html"} Naturalness: A Pragmatist’s Guide
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gian+Francesco+Giudice"}> Gian Francesco Giudice
                ,
                %em Naturally Speaking: The Naturalness Criterion and Physics at the LHC
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0801.2562"}> arXiv:0801.2562
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Porter+Williams"}> Porter Williams
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Naturalness, the autonomy of scales, and the 125 GeV Higgs
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1355219815000416"} publisher
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://philsci-archive.pitt.edu/11529/"} PhilSciArchive
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthew+Strassler"}> Matthew Strassler
                ,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://profmattstrassler.com/articles-and-posts/particle-physics-basics/the-hierarchy-problem/naturalness/"} Naturalness
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Simon+Friedrich"}> Simon Friedrich
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a{:href => "https://seop.illc.uva.nl/entries/fine-tuning/"} Fine-Tuning
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gian+Francesco+Giudice"}> Gian Francesco Giudice
                ,
                %em The Dawn of the Post-Naturalness Era
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.07663"}> arXiv:1710.07663
                )
            %li
              %p
                Arthur Hebecker,
                %em Lectures on Naturalness, String Landscape and Multiverse
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2008.10625"}> arXiv:2008.10625
                )
          %p An attempt to make the notion precise is due to
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Greg Anderson, Diego Castano,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Measures of fine tuning
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-ph/9409419"} arXiv:hep-ph/9409419
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/James+Wells"}> James Wells
                ,
                %em Evaluation and Utility of Wilsonian Naturalness
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.06082"}> arXiv:2107.06082
                )
          %p Critical comments are in
          %ul
            %li#Wilson04
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kenneth+Wilson"}> Kenneth Wilson
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The Origins of Lattice Gauge Theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-lat/0412043"} arXiv:hep-lat/0412043
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Petr+Horava"}> Petr Horava
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Surprises with Nonrelativistic Naturalness
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1608.06287"} arXiv:1608.06287
            %li#Kane17
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gordon+Kane"}> Gordon Kane
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em String theory and the real world
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://iopscience.iop.org/book/978-1-6817-4489-6"} doi:0.1088/978-1-6817-4489-6
            %li#Wells18a
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/James+Wells"}> James Wells
                ,
                %em Naturalness, Extra-Empirical Theory Assessments, and the Implications of Skepticism
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1806.07289"}> arXiv:1806.07289
                )
            %li#Wells18
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/James+Wells"}> James Wells
                ,
                %em Finetuned Cancellations and Improbable Theories
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.03374"}> arXiv:1809.03374
