                %em Hierarchy and decoupling
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.04470"}> arXiv:1902.04470
                )
            %li
              %p
                Goran Senjanovic,
                %em Natural Philosophy versus Philosophy of Naturalness
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2001.10988"}> arXiv:2001.10988
                )
            %li#Mooij-Shaposhnikov
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sander+Mooij"}> Sander Mooij
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Mikhail+Shaposhnikov"} Mikhail Shaposhnikov
                %em QFT without infinities and hierarchy problem
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.05175"}> arXiv:2110.05175
                \&amp;rbrack;
              %blockquote
                %p
                  The aim of this work has been to stress that there is no physical sense in the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/naturalness"} naturalness
                  criterion.
